  - placeId: haven.old_quarry.0
    name: The half-cut stone
    verb: Read the marks
    item: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 1
    taken: The pact's marks, cut half-way into the stone. They stopped in the middle of a word.
    offset: {x: 9.5, y: 3}
    marker: {fileID: 1987186056636952893, guid: 9c63895aedf974b41ac19d55902cc357, type: 3}
