    verb: Lift
    item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17b016991a7aa4846a121d6027443bf2, type: 2}
    amount: 1
    taken: Under the cracked hearthstone, a pouch of seed sealed in wax. They meant to sow again.
    offset: {x: -7.5, y: -5.5}
